        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "反正 + proposition",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "反正 states a point that holds regardless of the preceding alternatives. The speaker treats it as sufficient for the following stance.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "反正我有时间。",
                "pinyin": "fǎnzhèng wǒ yǒu shíjiān 。",
                "meaning": "In any case, I have time.",
                "audio": "e258b8f90d418c2a3f3ba9e4f83364ec21464533a3041ded8885f3e1b3ecdd76"
              },
              {
                "text": "你去不去，反正我要去。",
                "pinyin": "nǐ qù bù qù ， fǎnzhèng wǒ yào qù 。",
                "meaning": "Whether you go or not, I am going anyway.",
                "audio": "603467d29efc3c62600293ba158397b970cdb5ff9617730921c68bdda9d2eb7a"
              }
            ]
          },
